    <main v-else-if="page === 'news'" class="mx-auto max-w-[1240px] px-6 py-20 lg:px-10 lg:py-28"><div class="max-w-3xl"><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-[#2457e6]">品牌动态</p><h1 class="mt-5 text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-.07em]">记录一些正在发生的事。</h1><p class="mt-7 text-lg leading-8 text-[#68756f]">这里是暖巢智能的品牌与产品观察，当前内容为官网 mock 数据，用来展示企业网站的信息结构。</p></div><div class="mt-16 divide-y divide-[#dfe6df] border-y border-[#dfe6df]"><article v-for="item in news" :key="item.date" class="grid gap-5 py-10 sm:grid-cols-[120px_130px_1fr] sm:items-start"><time class="text-sm text-[#8b9791]">{{ item.date }}</time><span class="text-xs font-semibold text-[#2457e6]">{{ item.label }}</span><div><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-.04em]">{{ item.title }}</h2><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#748078]">{{ item.excerpt }}</p></div></article></div></main>

